    "itemBodyHtml": "<div class=\"row\">\n\t<div class=\"span6\"><div class=\"passageContent\" xml:base=\"VF581001_s.xml\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"passage-intro\" id=\"sr122\">Today you will research fossils. You will read the article “Miss Me?” Then you will read an article “Clues to Ancient Life” and view the video <i>Croc Fossil Found in Cave</i>. As you review these sources, you will gather information and answer questions about fossils so you can write an essay.</p></div></div>\n    \t<div class=\"stimulus\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"passage-scrolling passage440\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"passageContent\" xml:base=\"VF496993.xml\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><div class=\"stimulus_reference\"> <div class=\"passage\"> <div class=\"prose style:1\"> <p class=\"directions-passage\" id=\"sr\">Watch the video <em>Croc Fossil Found in Cave.</em> Then answer the questions.</p> </div> </div> </div></div><div class=\"abbi-video\"><div id=\"videoe6ca5\" class=\"videoaudio\"></div></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"copyright-tm\">Ngdm/National Geographic Stock</p></div></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"span6\"><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><h4>Part A</h4></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"stem_paragraph\" id=\"c1\">What point of view is developed in the video <i>Croc Fossil Found in Cave</i>?</p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"int-choice-list choice_list \" data-module=\"ChoiceInteraction\" data-maxchoices=\"1\" data-minchoices=\"1\" data-identifier=\"interaction_RESPONSE_A\">\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_6e55c\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_6e55c\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tA.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c2\">Explorers must pay close attention to their surroundings so that they do not miss a possible discovery.  </p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_1e3d3\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_1e3d3\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tB.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c3\">Scientists are finding new and successful ways to complete their research in an organized manner.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_b9108\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi3\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_b9108\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi3\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tC.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c4\">New locations may have exciting discoveries that will advance scientific research.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_1423a\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerAi4\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_1423a\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_A\" value=\"rAi4\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tD.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c5\">Remote caves are difficult to find and often dangerous to enter.</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><h4>Part B</h4></div><div class=\"abbi-richtext\"><p class=\"stem_paragraph\" id=\"c7\">Which sentence from the video <b class=\"stressed_text_1\">best </b>supports the answer to Part A?</p></div>\n\n<ul class=\"int-choice-list choice_list \" data-module=\"ChoiceInteraction\" data-maxchoices=\"1\" data-minchoices=\"1\" data-identifier=\"interaction_RESPONSE_B\">\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_72c08\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerBi1\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_72c08\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi1\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tA.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c8\">“The Dominican Republic can boast some very interesting finds in some of its freshwater caves that have been mostly unexplored until now.” [00:04]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_ca568\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerBi2\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_ca568\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi2\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tB.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c9\">“'This is something entirely new.'” [00:42]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_13afe\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerBi3\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_13afe\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi3\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tC.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c10\">“One of the crocodile skeletons is nearly complete, buried in silt except for the end of its snout.” [00:55]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n<li>\n\t<label class=\"radio\" for=\"choice_3e826\">\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-control choicerBi4\">\n\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" id=\"choice_3e826\" name=\"group_RESPONSE_B\" value=\"rBi4\" />\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"int-choice-label\">\n\t\t\tD.\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div  class=\"int-choice-desc \"><p class=\"choice_paragraph\" id=\"c11\">“One of the cave sites, discovered by locals, has a narrow vertical entrance under a fig tree in the country’s eastern province of La Altagracia.” [01:41]</p></div>\n\t</label>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n",
